				<guid>http://localhost:1313/audio/dulcimer/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;The logo can be composed of text, an icon from the &lt;a href=&#34;https://meteoricons.com/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;nofollow noopener&#34;&gt;Meteor Icons&lt;/a&gt; package along with text, or an image. Keep in mind that if you use an image, it is recommended to use the appropriate size or utilize the SVG format.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;parameters&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Parameters&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34; href=&#34;#parameters&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;In this case, you have two custom parameters available. If you want an icon alongside the text, define &lt;code&gt;logo_icon&lt;/code&gt; with the name of the icon you can obtain from &lt;a href=&#34;https://meteoricons.com/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;nofollow noopener&#34;&gt;Meteor Icons&lt;/a&gt;. If you want an image, define &lt;code&gt;logo_img&lt;/code&gt;. If you don&amp;rsquo;t define either of them, only the text will be displayed.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
