			<item>
				<title>2026</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/reading/2026/</link>
				<pubDate>Thu, 01 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/reading/2026/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;If you want your readers to be able to edit a page of your document on GitHub, you can enable the edit button in the header that contains the title.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;parameters&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Parameters&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34; href=&#34;#parameters&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;To activate the edit button, you need to add the following custom parameter to your goHugo configuration file. It should contain the exact path to the &amp;ldquo;content&amp;rdquo; folder:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;code&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;codetabs&#34;&gt;&lt;input id=&#34;tab-edcfba&#34; type=&#34;radio&#34; name=&#34;db54c8a8ccedcbdff54c4da16efc428c&#34; checked=&#34;checked&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;label for=&#34;tab-edcfba&#34;&gt;TOML&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-toml&#34; data-lang=&#34;toml&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;[&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;params&lt;/span&gt;]&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;github_repo_edit&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;https://github.com/zkreations/hudocs/tree/main/exampleSite/content&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;input id=&#34;tab-dafcbe&#34; type=&#34;radio&#34; name=&#34;db54c8a8ccedcbdff54c4da16efc428c&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;label for=&#34;tab-dafcbe&#34;&gt;YAML&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-yaml&#34; data-lang=&#34;yaml&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;params&lt;/span&gt;:&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;github_repo_edit&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;https://github.com/zkreations/hudocs/tree/main/exampleSite/content&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;input id=&#34;tab-afcdbe&#34; type=&#34;radio&#34; name=&#34;db54c8a8ccedcbdff54c4da16efc428c&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;label for=&#34;tab-afcdbe&#34;&gt;JSON&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-json&#34; data-lang=&#34;json&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;params&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; {&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;github_repo_edit&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;https://github.com/zkreations/hudocs/tree/main/exampleSite/content&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>2025</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/reading/2025/</link>
				<pubDate>Wed, 01 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/reading/2025/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;If you want your readers to be able to edit a page of your document on GitHub, you can enable the edit button in the header that contains the title.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;parameters&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Parameters&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34; href=&#34;#parameters&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;To activate the edit button, you need to add the following custom parameter to your goHugo configuration file. It should contain the exact path to the &amp;ldquo;content&amp;rdquo; folder:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;code&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;codetabs&#34;&gt;&lt;input id=&#34;tab-acdbef&#34; type=&#34;radio&#34; name=&#34;c8a5ceafd424d18cd8f54bfc64cbcdec&#34; checked=&#34;checked&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;label for=&#34;tab-acdbef&#34;&gt;TOML&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-toml&#34; data-lang=&#34;toml&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;[&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;params&lt;/span&gt;]&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;github_repo_edit&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;https://github.com/zkreations/hudocs/tree/main/exampleSite/content&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;input id=&#34;tab-abecfd&#34; type=&#34;radio&#34; name=&#34;c8a5ceafd424d18cd8f54bfc64cbcdec&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;label for=&#34;tab-abecfd&#34;&gt;YAML&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-yaml&#34; data-lang=&#34;yaml&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;params&lt;/span&gt;:&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;github_repo_edit&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;https://github.com/zkreations/hudocs/tree/main/exampleSite/content&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;input id=&#34;tab-badfec&#34; type=&#34;radio&#34; name=&#34;c8a5ceafd424d18cd8f54bfc64cbcdec&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;label for=&#34;tab-badfec&#34;&gt;JSON&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-json&#34; data-lang=&#34;json&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;params&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; {&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;github_repo_edit&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;https://github.com/zkreations/hudocs/tree/main/exampleSite/content&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
